.workbuddy/

# App runtime state
imgui.ini

# Generated output directories (results are written here at runtime;
# bundled sample data under descriptionData/, packedImport/, importFile/,
# experiment/, curve/, legacy/ and setting/ are intentionally tracked).
# The folders themselves are kept in git via .gitkeep placeholders so a
# fresh clone has them ready — the code writes results directly into them.
dxfResult/*
!dxfResult/.gitkeep
stlResult/*
!stlResult/.gitkeep
physResult/*
!physResult/.gitkeep
threadingResult/*
!threadingResult/.gitkeep
cdfResult/*
!cdfResult/.gitkeep
pdf/*
!pdf/.gitkeep

# Logs
*.log
